    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's such a heavy way to put it. \"letting the water come in\"... it's like there's no way out of the feeling. it just feels like a constant, low-grade misery knowing that everything we're building is just temporary. i look at people planning for twenty years from now and i just feel disconnected. like i'm already gone, even though i'm still standing here.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
